diff --git a/svc/docs/API.md b/svc/docs/API.md
index d96c758..d6e10e5 100644
--- a/svc/docs/API.md
+++ b/svc/docs/API.md
@@ -6,5 +6,22 @@
 | GET | /users | All users, by id. |
 | GET | /users/<id> | One user, or 404. |
 | POST | /users | Create a user from `{name, email}`. 201, 400 on invalid input, 409 if the email is taken. |
+| POST | /users/import | Create many users from `{"users": [{name, email}, ...]}`, all or nothing. See below. |
 
 A user is `{id, name, email}`.
+
+## POST /users/import
+
+Each entry is validated like `POST /users`. If any entry is bad, nothing is created.
+An email must not already exist in the service and must not appear twice in the
+batch; emails are compared ignoring capitalisation.
+
+| Status | When | Body |
+|---|---|---|
+| 201 | All users created | `{"users": [...]}`, in input order |
+| 400 | `users` missing, empty or not a list | `{"error": "..."}` |
+| 400 | An entry is not an object, or fails validation | `{"errors": [{"index": i, "errors": [...]}]}` |
+| 409 | Duplicate email (existing, or repeated in the batch) | `{"errors": [{"index": i, "error": "email already registered"}]}`; `i` is the later entry |
+| 413 | More than 100 users | `{"error": "..."}` |
+
+Validation (400) is checked before duplicates (409).
diff --git a/svc/store.py b/svc/store.py
